  "title": "Exploration: TotalEnergies and TPAO sign a Cooperation Agreement",
  "summary": "Paris / Istanbul, April 13, 2026 – TotalEnergies and Türkiye Petrolleri Anonim Ortaklığı (TPAO) signed today a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) on exploration opportunities. The MoU provides a framework for technical collaboration, including a joint assessment of exploration opportunities in the Black Sea region of Türkiye as well as internationally. “We are pleased to launch […]",
